
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>JPJ PAY</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;min-height:100vh;
 display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
 padding:20px;background:#080d18;
 color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif
}
.card{
 width:100%;max-width:380px;padding:28px;
 background:#121c30;border:1px solid #263b5c;
 border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px #0008
}
.logo{text-align:center;font-size:34px;font-weight:bold;color:#36a3ff}
.sub{text-align:center;color:#aab6ca;margin:10px 0 30px}
h2{text-align:center}
label{display:block;margin:18px 0 8px}
input{
 width:100%;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;
 border:1px solid #344966;background:#091426;
 color:white;font-size:16px
}
button{
 width:100%;padding:15px;margin-top:22px;
 border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#1685ff;
 color:white;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold
}
.note{text-align:center;color:#9eacc1;font-size:12px;margin-top:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
 <div class="logo">JPJ PAY</div>
 <div class="sub">Welcome Back</div>
 <h2>Sign In</h2>

 <label>Mobile Number</label>
 <input type="tel" placeholder="Enter mobile number">

 <label>Password</label>
 <input type="password" placeholder="Enter password">

 <button onclick="alert('This is a demo login page. No account or payment is connected.')">
 Sign In
 </button>

 <div class="note">
 Demo website • No real payments or credentials
 </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
